  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avrop ramavtal RBM f&#xf6;r TEI ICT-reglering</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-off from RBM framework agreement for TEI on IT-regulation - Cal-off from RBM framework agreement for TEI on IT-regulation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den h&#xe4;r insatsen &#xe4;r skapat f&#xf6;r att bidra till framtagandet/utvecklingen av en ny EU-gemensam insats (EU-delegering av medel/Team Europe Initiative) som planeras mellan EU, Sida och Luxemburg. Insatsen planeras som en vidareutveckling av en existerande ITP-insats (PLANit ID 54120237). Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att upphandla st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n NIRAS f&#xf6;r framtagandet av ett RBM-ramverk f&#xf6;r den kommande insatsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution has been created to support the development of an Joint Action (EU delegation of the Medium/Team Europe Initiative) planned between the EU, Sida and Luxembourg. The forthcoming contribution is planned as a further development of an existing ITP effort (Planit ID 54120237). The purpose of this contribution is to procure support from Niras for the development of an RBM framework for the upcoming Joint Action.</narrative>
  </description>
